---
description: Python backend (FastAPI, extractors, services)
globs: src/**/*.py,tests/**/*.py,alembic/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---
- New extraction / CV code → `src/copy_that/extractors/`. Don't add modules to `src/copy_that/application/`.
- Keep routers thin; put logic in `services/`. Ship an Alembic migration with any schema change.
- Tests go in `tests/unit` or `tests/integration` (the only dirs CI runs). No network; no reliance on `.env`.
- After editing: `make check` (or at least `.venv/bin/ruff check --fix <file> && .venv/bin/ruff format <file>`).
